DESCRIPTION:JD and graduate students who hold F-1 or J-1 visas must atten
 d this information session presented by the Office of International Servi
 ces. Learn about eligibility requirements and application procedures for 
 receiving Curricular Practical Training (during your studies)\, Optional 
 Practical Training (after your studies) or Academic Training (J-1 student
 s) authorization so that you can work or intern in your field of study le
 gally.
